<title>JAPAN: Japan Steel Works - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Japan Steel Works - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 64.58		vs	   47.28</p>
<p> Operating     prft 1.02		vs     loss 1.76</p>
<p> Current	  prft 128 million	  vs     loss 3.02</p>
<p> Net		 prft 48 million	  vs     loss 4.94</p>
